  "_overrides_note": "siginfo/stackback pinned to the exact versions vitest's why-is-node-running already requests, sidesteps an npm bug (through npm 12) where an empty-version placeholder siginfo node makes `npm ci` throw `Invalid Version:` in canDedupe on this tree.",
